From d834d9748d1649f0f8240649865ad3048660a19c Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Devandroid-bit <180217512+Devandroid-bit@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 5 Nov 2026 08:37:35 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 1/3] BACKPORT: mm: proactive compaction

Backport proactive compaction and its follow-up fixes to the
Exynos9820 4.14 tree.

Backported from: Galaxy S24 6.1 (S921BXXSGDZG1), based on
upstream v5.9 commit facdaa917c4d5a376d09d25865f5a863f906234a
("mm: proactive compaction").

Included upstream fixes:
- d34c0a7599ea ("mm: use unsigned types for fragmentation score")
- 40d7e2032007 ("mm/compaction: correct deferral logic for proactive compaction")
- e1e92bfa3825 ("mm: compaction: optimize proactive compaction deferrals")
- 1bfb7684db12 ("mm: compaction: count the migration scanned pages events
  for proactive compaction")

Adapted for 4.14:
- kcompactd already lives in mm/compaction.c; use the local
  compact_zone(zone, cc) and __compact_finished(zone, cc) signatures.
- mm/vmscan.c is not touched, so the MGLRU backport is preserved.
- the sysctl defaults to 20 and can be disabled by writing 0 to
  /proc/sys/vm/compaction_proactiveness.

Signed-off-by: Devandroid-bit <180217512+Devandroid-bit@users.noreply.github.com>
Author: @Devandroid-bit.
